    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just hard to talk to a professional about this because they always try to \"fix\" it or ground me. but i don't want to be grounded. i feel like the weight of just existing is too much and there's no point in trying to find an anchor when the whole world feels so hollow. it's less like a crisis and more like just... realizing there's nothing there.",
